{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This demo features the game\u2019s opening sequence. Offering about 50\u201360 minutes of gameplay. Explore the immersive laboratory environment as you begin to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge. Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/9d39da558592b7b0e11d513c8ed22025.avif?t=1759255407\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.poster.avif?t=1759255407\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.webm?t=1759255407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.mp4?t=1759255407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/fb4f490ed0f1adb4480a1c3771475503.avif?t=1759255407\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.poster.avif?t=1759255407\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.webm?t=1759255407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.mp4?t=1759255407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/2d8a98ad60bed345e381a9859ee4339a.avif?t=1759255407\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.poster.avif?t=1759255407\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.webm?t=1759255407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.mp4?t=1759255407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791840?t=1759255407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/c7262a83881f0620bd2f4a299e1a712af822cac9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759255407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/2af7f9d3f33d7b02a59d199df240652a5721111d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759255407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791840/2af7f9d3f33d7b02a59d199df240652a5721111d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759255407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: F